{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_181_death_mask_ev_appear.txt/0": "上当了吧，蠢货！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_181_death_mask_ev_appear.txt/1": "连你也一起吃掉！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_181_death_mask_ev_appear.txt/2": "嘿嘿，我开动了～",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_181_death_mask_ev_talk.txt/0": "小心背后，\r\n可别被我夺舍了……呵呵。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_181_death_mask_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>似乎\r\n咧开嘴笑了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/0": "哦……我还以为是怪物闯进了城堡，\r\n原来是\\c[50]\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]\\c[0]啊。\r\n哈哈哈，失礼了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/1": "哦！女王陛下！\r\n您终于要亲自踏上\r\n旅途了吗！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/2": "哦！\\c[50]\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]\\c[0]！\r\n您真是长大了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/3": "您应该还没有忘记\r\n我们上课时教过的\r\n战斗基础吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/4": "剑士以高攻击力著称，\r\n与其他职业相比，\r\n常常能一击解决敌人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/5": "WT上限也很优秀，是很容易上手的职业！\r\n武器方面，当然最擅长\r\n使用剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/6": "骑士强大的防御能力很有魅力。\r\n只要备好恢复物品，\r\n就算正面迎战堕天使也不会落后。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/7": "而且被众多敌人包围时，\r\n生存率非常高，\r\n这也是该职业的魅力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/8": "盾牌的实际减伤效果为两倍。\r\n要好好管理武器、防具和\r\n追加装备的耐久，别在关键时刻损坏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/9": "弓手正如其名，擅长使用弓。\r\n出色的索敌能力\r\n也是这一职业的魅力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/10": "可以边跑边保持距离，\r\n用高精度的远程攻击\r\n解决敌人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/11": "这一职业攻击与回避俱佳。\r\n不过也因此难兼顾所有方面，\r\n可能落得样样通、样样松。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/12": "不过随着成长，\r\n应该能学会类似盗贼的\r\n实用技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/13": "术士只要有足够等级，\r\n就能在任何地方\r\n学习新的魔法。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/14": "能够学会的魔法数量有限，\r\n所以何时学习何种魔法，\r\n或许会让人难以抉择。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/15": "此外，施放某些魔法前\r\n必须先“集中”。\r\n因此需要提前一步思考。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/16": "海盗擅长在水上移动和战斗，\r\n因此不会被海岸地区\r\n难住。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/17": "即使遇到强敌，只要对方不是鱼类\r\n或飞行怪物，就可以越过水面\r\n撤退！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/18": "冒险者的魅力在于出色的\r\n移动能力！游泳和登山都很在行。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/19": "冒险者从一开始就擅长\\c[52]开锁\\c[0]，\r\n其他职业只能放弃的危险宝物，\r\n冒险者或许也能尝试取得。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/20": "兽人生来HP和ST较高，\r\n敏捷成长也很优秀。\r\n不过不擅长魔法。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/21": "夜视能力冠绝所有职业，\r\n夜间移动时很少\r\n遭到突袭。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/23": "游侠是擅长在山地移动的职业，\r\n并且拥有开锁技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/24": "虽然不擅长正面战斗……\r\n但与野兽战斗时\r\n多少有些优势。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/25": "而且游侠食用腐败食物\r\n也不会食物中毒。从这个意义上说，\r\n或许很适合长途旅行。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/26": "枪手正如其名，是擅长使用枪械的\r\n职业。若不装备枪械，\r\n有些技能就无法发挥效果。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/27": "枪手还能制作枪械，\r\n枪械的运用方式将左右\r\n冒险的成败。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/28": "勇者十分强大，\r\n但遭到侧面和背后攻击时很脆弱。\r\n千万不要让敌人进入视野死角！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/29": "据说升到\\c[52]3级\\c[0]后，\r\n就能学会传说中的魔法，\r\n不过……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/30": "刺客的魅力在于，\r\n凭借高敏捷与攻击力，\r\n掌握种类繁多的技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/31": "不过这些技能都很耗资源，\r\n懂得酌情使用，\r\n才是制胜关键。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/32": "暗黑骑士的初始能力很高，\r\n防御性能也很优秀。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/33": "技能虽带有负面效果，\r\n但在1对1时很强大。\r\n若判断失误，留下敌人HP就会很危险。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/34": "暗黑骑士擅长剑以外的近战武器，\r\n却极其不擅长身为王道武器的剑。\r\n真是个古怪的职业。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/35": "格斗家是天生的拳斗高手，\r\n徒手战斗能力\r\n首屈一指。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/36": "只要学会精神统一，\r\n一击伤害就能飞跃提升。\r\n而且锻炼过的身体也便于跨越复杂地形。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/37": "不过不擅长使用普通武器，\r\n也无法充分发挥\r\n防具性能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/38": "牧师修习恢复之术。\r\n与术士相比火力较弱，\r\n但能使用恢复类魔法。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/39": "初期无法使用攻击魔法，\r\n因此建议在那之前\r\n谨慎前进。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/40": "亡灵对不死生物格外强大，\r\n学会的攻击魔法也都是\r\n针对不死生物的特化技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/41": "……话虽如此，与其他职业相比，\r\n僵尸其实非常弱小。\r\n见到强敌时不要交战，立刻逃跑吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/42": "僵尸虽然HP很高，却很怕火，\r\n与使用业火魔法的堕天使战斗\r\n会非常艰难。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/43": "若能设法提升等级，\r\n学会技能，或许还有机会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/44": "女王职业嘛……\r\n其长处在于天生\r\n拥有极高的魅力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/45": "用魅力招揽同伴替你战斗，\r\n自己则从旁掩护，\r\n是女王擅长的战法。记得常备肉盾。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/46": "看来她不太擅长对付不死生物。\r\n是觉得害怕吗？意外地可爱……\r\n呃，不，没什么，失礼了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/47": "至于占星术士，\r\n他们是术士中\r\n专门负责侦测的专家。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/48": "可以把所有地牢和城镇标到地图上。\r\n识别能力也首屈一指，\r\n习得侦测魔法所需成本很低。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/49": "武士在濒死时能发挥强大力量，\r\nHP降到25%以下时，\r\n战斗能力反而会提升。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/50": "另外，12级学会的“一刃”\r\n起初虽然很弱，\r\n但听说会随着使用而变强。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/52": "幻兽猎人专门对付特殊怪物，\r\n能够对强大或大型的敌人\r\n造成巨大伤害。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/53": "看来擅长剑和拳斗武器。\r\n魔法与远程武器\r\n则不太擅长。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/55": "盾牌性能与其他职业相同，\r\n但拥有与骑士相同的后背防御力，\r\n还能将火焰与电击伤害减半。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/56": "幻兽猎人还擅长与龙类战斗，\r\n这一特性在冒险中后期\r\n会大有帮助。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/57": "力士的特征是能以\r\n仅剩一点HP的状态撑住。\r\n面对沉重的一击时很有用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/58": "虽然完全无法装备，\r\n但WT上限很优秀，\r\n或许需要靠灵活运用物品来战斗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/59": "12级学会的技能“推掌”\r\n会随着使用而进化，\r\n击退敌人的性能似乎也会提高。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/61": "还会学会在短时间内\r\n强化自身的技能。\r\n这些强大技能很适合短期决战。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_186_soldier_b_ev_talk.txt/62": "擅长使用所有类型的武器，\r\n但若没有同时装备武器、防具\r\n与追加装备，就会受到弱化惩罚。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_find.txt/0": "嗯？这家伙，\r\n不……大概是错觉吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_find.txt/1": "喂喂！你这身打扮\r\n是怎么回事？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_find.txt/2": "唔哇！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_find.txt/3": "欢迎！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_find.txt/4": "你能来到这里，干得不错。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_find.txt/5": "好好歇一会儿吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/0": "……把衣服穿上……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/1": "喂、喂，快把衣服穿上！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/2": "你这家伙！若想扰乱此地和平，\r\n我可绝不会饶你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/3": "哎呀呀，女王陛下。\r\n您是在巡视吗？\r\n远道而来，辛苦了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/4": "我是这里的卫兵，\r\n负责守护这片土地的和平。\r\n罪犯会立刻被我驱逐，请交给我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/5": "我是卫兵，守护这里和平\r\n就是我的职责。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_talk.txt/6": "而犯罪之人会立刻被驱逐，\r\n这就是我的工作。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_187_guard_ev_wanted.txt/0": "犯罪的渣滓！受死吧！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_find.txt/0": "咦？这个人，\r\n不……是错觉吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_find.txt/1": "哇！……\r\n你、你是……全裸？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_find.txt/2": "……咦？（用力擦眼）\r\n你、你是……全裸？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_find.txt/3": "欢迎！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_find.txt/4": "你能一路来到这里，真了不起。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_find.txt/5": "出发前好好休息吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_talk.txt/0": "呜哇啊，快、快穿上衣服！\r\n我都不知道该往哪里看了！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_talk.txt/1": "呃……这是现在流行的\r\n打扮吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_talk.txt/2": "你、你这可疑的家伙！\r\n来这里有何目的！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_talk.txt/3": "女王陛下，能见到您是我的荣幸。\r\n我在这里担任卫兵。\r\n请安心休息吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_talk.txt/4": "我是这里的卫兵，\r\n希望您不是恶人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_talk.txt/5": "和平最重要。\r\n请好好放松休息吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_188_ledy_guard_ev_wanted.txt/0": "唔，是罪犯……\r\n站住！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/0": "你……\r\n是僵尸？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/1": "梦幻仓库……只属于勇者……\r\n……走开。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/3": "……走开。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/4": "……梦幻仓库……\r\n不能在这里打开……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/5": "……对不起。\r\n加油……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/6": "……\r\n……你好。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/897": "打开梦幻仓库",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/928": "梦幻仓库是什么？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/967": "\\c[4]取消",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/7": "梦幻……仓库……\r\n……你要怎么做？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/1173": "打开梦幻仓库",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/1204": "梦幻仓库是什么？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/1243": "够了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/8": "梦幻……仓库……\r\n还要……继续用吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/9": "……嗯。\r\n请……等一下……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/10": "……\r\n……加油。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/11": "……\r\n……你不使用吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/13": "……那样或许更好。\r\n……加油。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/14": "……\r\n……我明白了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/15": "……\r\n梦幻仓库……\r\n……与梦幻的空间……相连。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/16": "世界……时间……\r\n只要越过那道屏障……\r\n物品的转交……就能做到。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/18": "梦幻仓库里的物品……\r\n可以存入和取出……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/19": "……只有在你……\r\n……通关游戏后才行。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/20": "即使取出了物品……\r\n只要还不保存……\r\n……就能再次取出同一件物品。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/21": "……取出之后……\r\n一旦保存或通关……\r\n同样的物品就无法再取出了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/22": "梦幻仓库……\r\n栏位有限……\r\n所以要好好利用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_189_dimension_warehouse_ev_talk.txt/23": "……\r\n……呼。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "总之，努力试试就好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "哎呀哎呀，是位旅人？\r\n怎么……你对自己的模样不吃惊吗？\r\n呵呵，别看我这样，我可是占卜师呢。"
